        <article class="service">
          <h3>Wi-Fi Installation</h3>
          <p>Home and business Wi-Fi setup,
          coverage improvement and troubleshooting.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="service">
          <h3>Router Configuration</h3>
          <p>Router setup, Wi-Fi passwords,
          network configuration and connectivity support.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="service">
